  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656484",
      "title": "TD: Grouping Form Controls",
      "lectureOrder": 521,
      "videoOrder": 477,
      "sourceHash": "b0e720ae95a84c1e6e530a0eec60395d2499b2cd62d81c1b7cd016c908133eeb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.82,
          "end": 5.61,
          "en": "-: Our form has evolved quite a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.61,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "Now let's say that on the value object we get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 12.24,
          "en": "when we submit the form, we want to group some things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.24,
          "end": 14.52,
          "en": "For example we want to group the secret",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.52,
          "end": 17.28,
          "en": "and the question answer into username and email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.28,
          "end": 20.49,
          "en": "to just have some structure in our object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.49,
          "end": 22.41,
          "en": "because for a very big form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.41,
          "end": 25.14,
          "en": "we might want to have such a structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.14,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "This would also be nice if we could",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 30.45,
          "en": "then validate the validity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.45,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "the status of our individual groups of inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "Turns out that's easy to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 37.65,
          "en": "with the template-driven approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.65,
          "end": 40.879,
          "en": "Here on our first group username and email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.879,
          "end": 45.36,
          "en": "I already have a wrapping div with the ID user data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.36,
          "end": 48.03,
          "en": "Now you can simply place another directive on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.03,
          "end": 51.72,
          "en": "the ngModelGroup directive like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.72,
          "end": 55.05,
          "en": "and this will now group this into,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.05,
          "end": 57.48,
          "en": "well you guessed it, a group of inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.48,
          "end": 62.48,
          "en": "However, ngModel group needs to be set equal to a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 65.43,
          "en": "So for example, user data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.43,
          "end": 69.24,
          "en": "this will be the key name for this group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.24,
          "end": 72.81,
          "en": "So now if I save this with ngModel group added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.81,
          "end": 77.81,
          "en": "if I enter value here and here and hit submit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.88,
          "end": 80.094,
          "en": "and we have a look at the value of the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.094,
          "end": 83.34,
          "en": "you now see that we have a user data field here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.34,
          "end": 85.23,
          "en": "which holds another object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.23,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "where we now have email and username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 93.11,
          "en": "Now, not only did we add this extra field in our value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 97.97999999999999,
          "en": "we also now have a different setup here in controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.97999999999999,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "Here we also now have a user data control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 104.28,
          "en": "with all the properties, you know on those controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.28,
          "end": 106.44,
          "en": "like valid and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.44,
          "end": 111.44,
          "en": "So if we now simply inspect our HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 115.44,
          "en": "and this div with the ID user data, you see that there also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.44,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "we got the ng-dirty, touched and valid clauses added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 122.79,
          "en": "So you can now also check the validity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.79,
          "end": 126.09,
          "en": "of this overall control here, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.09,
          "end": 129.66,
          "en": "which might be a nice feature in your form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.66,
          "end": 134.66,
          "en": "You can also get access to the Java script representation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.75,
          "end": 138.18,
          "en": "by again adding a local rough reference to the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.18,
          "end": 141.06,
          "en": "which holds the ngModel group directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.06,
          "end": 145.11,
          "en": "Here, for example, user data would be a fitting name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.11,
          "end": 148.17000000000002,
          "en": "and then setting this equal to ngModel group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.17000000000002,
          "end": 151.5,
          "en": "So just like we did before with email, which was equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "to ngModel, I'm now setting this reference equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 158.64,
          "en": "to ngModel group to get access to this JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 162.404,
          "en": "And this would allow us to, for example, output a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.404,
          "end": 165,
          "en": "if this whole group is not valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165,
          "end": 167.425,
          "en": "So we could simply output a paragraph here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.425,
          "end": 171.37,
          "en": "User data is invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 175.203,
          "en": "which we add if userData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.305,
          "end": 180.414,
          "en": "this is the local reference created here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.414,
          "end": 183.51,
          "en": "If userData is not valid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.51,
          "end": 186.03,
          "en": "and let's say it has been touched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.03,
          "end": 189.9,
          "en": "So userData.touched is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 191.883,
          "en": "With that, if this reloads,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 193.14,
          "end": 194.79,
          "en": "you see that we don't see any message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.79,
          "end": 197.52,
          "en": "but as soon as I click into one of the fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.52,
          "end": 200.91,
          "en": "and then leave it, you see user data as invalid was shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.91,
          "end": 204.51,
          "en": "So now you really got a very fine grain control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.51,
          "end": 207.633,
          "en": "over your form with all these tools.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
